{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-8d1986e2a8c478364e0e","title":"明帝幸尚方使卞兰难高堂隆礼乐论帝称善","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-8d1986e2a8c478364e0e","label":"正文","text":"明帝幸尚方使卞兰难高堂隆礼乐论帝称善","evidence":["xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"命难问称善","evidence":["xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2"]},{"person":"houfei-p0010","role":"难问","evidence":["xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0041","role":"答问","evidence":["xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2","order":5102}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0010","name":"卞兰","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0041","name":"高堂隆","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-762249ccee3b6381f2d2","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-7ce60c7bf3e99856e1c7","layer":"original","quote":"是日，帝幸尚方，隆与卞兰从〖8〗。帝以隆表授兰，使难隆曰：“兴衰在政，乐何为也〖9〗？化之不明，岂钟之罪？”隆曰：“夫礼乐者，为治之大本也。故‘箫韶九成〖10〗，凤凰来仪〖11〗’；雷鼓六变〖12〗，天神以降；政是以平，刑是以措〖13〗：和之至也。新声发响〖14〗，商辛以陨〖15〗；大钟既铸，周景以弊。存亡之机，恒由斯作，安在废兴之不阶也〖16〗？君举必书〖17〗，古之道也；作而不法〖18〗，何以示后？圣王乐闻其阙〖19〗，故有箴规之道；忠臣愿竭其节，故有匪躬之义也〖20〗。”帝称善。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":245}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
